      "cues": [
        {
          "id": 1,
          "start": 2.04,
          "end": 3.06,
          "en": "Now let's get started",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 2,
          "start": 3.06,
          "end": 6.55,
          "en": "with writing some NextJS code here.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 3,
          "start": 6.55,
          "end": 9.53,
          "en": "And for this I'll shrink the terminal a little bit.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 4,
          "start": 9.53,
          "end": 11.69,
          "en": "And in this pages folder,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 5,
          "start": 11.69,
          "end": 15,
          "en": "we can ignore this _app.js file for the moment.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 6,
          "start": 15,
          "end": 18.04,
          "en": "We can delete the api folder in there.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 7,
          "start": 18.04,
          "end": 19.35,
          "en": "And in the styles folder",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 8,
          "start": 19.35,
          "end": 22.75,
          "en": "we can also delete the Home.module.css file.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 9,
          "start": 22.75,
          "end": 24.93,
          "en": "We can keep the globals.css file",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 10,
          "start": 24.93,
          "end": 25.853,
          "en": "if we want though.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 11,
          "start": 26.9,
          "end": 29.09,
          "en": "Now we got this index.js file.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 12,
          "start": 29.09,
          "end": 30.053,
          "en": "And in this file,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 13,
          "start": 30.053,
          "end": 35.053,
          "en": "* in the end just have a standard React component.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 14,
          "start": 35.27,
          "end": 36.58,
          "en": "But to make this even clearer",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 15,
          "start": 36.58,
          "end": 38.35,
          "en": "let's delete this file as well",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 16,
          "start": 38.35,
          "end": 41.33,
          "en": "so that the only remaining file in the pages folder",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 17,
          "start": 41.33,
          "end": 43.89,
          "en": "is the _app.js file.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 18,
          "start": 43.89,
          "end": 47.16,
          "en": "And now let's say to get started with NextJS",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 19,
          "start": 47.16,
          "end": 51.51,
          "en": "we wanna build a simple website with three kinds of pages,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 20,
          "start": 51.51,
          "end": 53.15,
          "en": "a starting page let's say,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 21,
          "start": 53.15,
          "end": 56.23,
          "en": "then a news page with a list of news",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 22,
          "start": 56.23,
          "end": 59.06,
          "en": "and then a page for the news details.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 23,
          "start": 59.06,
          "end": 61.249,
          "en": "So when we click on a news item",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 24,
          "start": 61.249,
          "end": 63.9,
          "en": "and we're taken to the full page",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 25,
          "start": 63.9,
          "end": 66.71,
          "en": "for that specific news item.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 26,
          "start": 66.71,
          "end": 69.78,
          "en": "And if we wanted to create a structure like this,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 27,
          "start": 69.78,
          "end": 72.45,
          "en": "in NextJS in the pages folder here,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 28,
          "start": 72.45,
          "end": 75.6,
          "en": "we would create three files.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 29,
          "start": 75.6,
          "end": 78.96000000000001,
          "en": "The index.js file will be our route page.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 30,
          "start": 78.96000000000001,
          "end": 82.37,
          "en": "So if a request reaches our domain slash nothing",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 31,
          "start": 82.37,
          "end": 84.93,
          "en": "just index.js will be loaded.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 32,
          "start": 84.93,
          "end": 87.92,
          "en": "That is in line with standard websites,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 33,
          "start": 87.92,
          "end": 89.76,
          "en": "if I may call it like this",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 34,
          "start": 89.76,
          "end": 92.72,
          "en": "where we also have index.html files",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 35,
          "start": 92.72,
          "end": 95.22999999999999,
          "en": "which are typically served as route pages,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 36,
          "start": 95.22999999999999,
          "end": 99.95,
          "en": "if a request just targets slash nothing after the domain.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 37,
          "start": 99.95,
          "end": 102.58,
          "en": "And here it's index.js, which will be served",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 38,
          "start": 102.58,
          "end": 106.313,
          "en": "if a request reaches just our domain slash nothing.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 39,
          "start": 107.24000000000001,
          "end": 110.15,
          "en": "Then we might also have a news.js file",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 40,
          "start": 110.15,
          "end": 113.78,
          "en": "for requests that reach our domain slash news.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 41,
          "start": 113.78,
          "end": 117.52000000000001,
          "en": "And that's important with the exception of the index name",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 42,
          "start": 117.52000000000001,
          "end": 118.372,
          "en": "which is a special name,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 43,
          "start": 118.372,
          "end": 119.85,
          "en": "which is served whenever",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 44,
          "start": 119.85,
          "end": 122.92,
          "en": "we have a request to just slash nothing,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 45,
          "start": 122.92,
          "end": 126.37,
          "en": "the file name will be used as a path name.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 46,
          "start": 126.37,
          "end": 128.92,
          "en": "So news.js the content in here,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 47,
          "start": 128.92,
          "end": 130.75,
          "en": "the React component in here,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 48,
          "start": 130.75,
          "end": 135.054,
          "en": "would be served for requests to our domain slash news,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 49,
          "start": 135.054,
          "end": 137.26,
          "en": "for example.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 50,
          "start": 137.26,
          "end": 139.6,
          "en": "So not news.js, but just news.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 51,
          "start": 139.6,
          "end": 142.31,
          "en": "Then then news.js file would be served.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 52,
          "start": 142.31,
          "end": 145.05,
          "en": "And I'll comment this out to leave that in here.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 53,
          "start": 145.05,
          "end": 149.053,
          "en": "index.js would be served for just our domain.com/nothing.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 54,
          "start": 150.14,
          "end": 151.66,
          "en": "And I'll come back to the page",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 55,
          "start": 151.66,
          "end": 154.24,
          "en": "for a single news item later.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 56,
          "start": 154.24,
          "end": 157.41,
          "en": "For the moment, these are the two pages we have.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 57,
          "start": 157.41,
          "end": 160.53,
          "en": "And now what goes in those page files,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 58,
          "start": 160.53,
          "end": 161.85,
          "en": "I mentioned it before,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 59,
          "start": 161.85,
          "end": 164,
          "en": "our standard React component,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 60,
          "start": 164,
          "end": 166.85,
          "en": "the React components that should be loaded",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 61,
          "start": 166.85,
          "end": 168.573,
          "en": "for that specific page.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 62,
          "start": 169.55,
          "end": 170.82,
          "en": "So here in index.js",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 63,
          "start": 170.82,
          "end": 173.69,
          "en": "we can create a component just as we know it",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 64,
          "start": 173.69,
          "end": 174.937,
          "en": "typically as a function",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 65,
          "start": 174.937,
          "end": 177.75,
          "en": "and we could name it as HomePage.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 66,
          "start": 177.75,
          "end": 179.92000000000002,
          "en": "The component name is up to you.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 67,
          "start": 179.92000000000002,
          "end": 182.73,
          "en": "Now you must export this component",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 68,
          "start": 182.73,
          "end": 187.6,
          "en": "so that NextJS is able to find it, so to say.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 69,
          "start": 187.6,
          "end": 189.95,
          "en": "And then in this component function",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 70,
          "start": 189.95,
          "end": 191.65,
          "en": "you return JSX code",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 71,
          "start": 191.65,
          "end": 194.14,
          "en": "just as you're used to.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 72,
          "start": 194.14,
          "end": 196.05,
          "en": "You return your JSX code,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 73,
          "start": 196.05,
          "end": 200.96,
          "en": "for example, a h1 tag where we say \"The Home Page.\"",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 74,
          "start": 200.96,
          "end": 203.47,
          "en": "That could be a very simple first page.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 75,
          "start": 203.47,
          "end": 206.05,
          "en": "Of course we're going to add more meaningful content",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 76,
          "start": 206.05,
          "end": 207.52,
          "en": "in a second.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 77,
          "start": 207.52,
          "end": 210.2,
          "en": "Now we can copy this to news.js",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 78,
          "start": 210.2,
          "end": 211.64,
          "en": "and add it here.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 79,
          "start": 211.64,
          "end": 212.51,
          "en": "As a side note,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 80,
          "start": 212.51,
          "end": 216.25,
          "en": "if you're wondering why we don't have any import statement",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 81,
          "start": 216.25,
          "end": 217.72,
          "en": "like this at the top,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 82,
          "start": 217.72,
          "end": 220.09,
          "en": "where we import React from react.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 83,
          "start": 220.09,
          "end": 225.09,
          "en": "NextJS projects support this modern React setup",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 84,
          "start": 225.17000000000002,
          "end": 227.46,
          "en": "where you can omit this import",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 85,
          "start": 227.46,
          "end": 230.61,
          "en": "and it's added behind the scenes, so to say.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 86,
          "start": 230.61,
          "end": 231.44299999999998,
          "en": "And with that here",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 87,
          "start": 231.44299999999998,
          "end": 232.36,
          "en": "in the news.js file",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 88,
          "start": 232.36,
          "end": 235.53,
          "en": "we would have let's say NewsPage component",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 89,
          "start": 235.53,
          "end": 238.22,
          "en": "and of course also export the news page,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 90,
          "start": 238.22,
          "end": 240.737,
          "en": "and here we could say \"The News Page.\"",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 91,
          "start": 241.68,
          "end": 242.99,
          "en": "And if we do that,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 92,
          "start": 242.99,
          "end": 245.14,
          "en": "if we add these two pages",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 93,
          "start": 245.14,
          "end": 246.77,
          "en": "then in the terminal,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 94,
          "start": 246.77,
          "end": 248.79,
          "en": "in this integrated terminal here",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 95,
          "start": 248.79,
          "end": 252.24,
          "en": "which has already navigated into this project folder",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 96,
          "start": 252.24,
          "end": 256.37,
          "en": "we can start the development server with NPM and run dev.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 97,
          "start": 256.37,
          "end": 257.73,
          "en": "And that development server",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 98,
          "start": 257.73,
          "end": 261.74,
          "en": "is given to us by that NextJS project setup.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 99,
          "start": 261.74,
          "end": 262.85,
          "en": "So with npm run dev,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 100,
          "start": 262.85,
          "end": 264.75,
          "en": "we start this development server.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 101,
          "start": 264.75,
          "end": 269.09,
          "en": "Here you see the URL where you can visit your page",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 102,
          "start": 269.09,
          "end": 272.69,
          "en": "and therefore if I now visit localhost:3000",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 103,
          "start": 272.69,
          "end": 275.37,
          "en": "I see the homepage.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 104,
          "start": 275.37,
          "end": 279.36,
          "en": "And if we instead would visit localhost:3000/news",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 105,
          "start": 279.36,
          "end": 281.89,
          "en": "we see the news page.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 106,
          "start": 281.89,
          "end": 283.55,
          "en": "And now what's interesting is",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 107,
          "start": 283.55,
          "end": 286.54,
          "en": "that the content is just some dummy content,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 108,
          "start": 286.54,
          "end": 290.49,
          "en": "but if we view the page source here",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 109,
          "start": 290.49,
          "end": 292.7,
          "en": "off the loaded page,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 110,
          "start": 292.7,
          "end": 294.59000000000003,
          "en": "then we see that in there",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 111,
          "start": 294.59000000000003,
          "end": 297.31,
          "en": "we don't just have an empty skeleton,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 112,
          "start": 297.31,
          "end": 298.8,
          "en": "but if we look up at closer,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 113,
          "start": 298.8,
          "end": 302.41,
          "en": "we find the actual page content in here.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 114,
          "start": 302.41,
          "end": 304.43,
          "en": "And that's an important difference",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 115,
          "start": 304.43,
          "end": 305.91,
          "en": "to a standard React app",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 116,
          "start": 305.91,
          "end": 310.04,
          "en": "where the page is not pre-rendered on the server.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 117,
          "start": 310.04,
          "end": 312.84,
          "en": "This HTML code which we see here",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 118,
          "start": 312.84,
          "end": 316.56,
          "en": "is the HTML code sent back by the server.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 119,
          "start": 316.56,
          "end": 319.08,
          "en": "And since it contains that content here",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 120,
          "start": 319.08,
          "end": 323.29,
          "en": "that means that the entire page was pre-rendered.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 121,
          "start": 323.29,
          "end": 325.58,
          "en": "And that's why the content ends up in here",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 122,
          "start": 325.58,
          "end": 326.73,
          "en": "and the advantage's",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 123,
          "start": 326.73,
          "end": 328.359,
          "en": "that we don't have any flickering on the page",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 124,
          "start": 328.359,
          "end": 330.55,
          "en": "whilst we're waiting for it.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 125,
          "start": 330.55,
          "end": 331.94,
          "en": "And in addition,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 126,
          "start": 331.94,
          "end": 336.06,
          "en": "search engines would also see that content here.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 127,
          "start": 336.06,
          "end": 337.92,
          "en": "They see what our users see",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 128,
          "start": 337.92,
          "end": 340.95,
          "en": "and that of course can be a great advantage.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 129,
          "start": 340.95,
          "end": 342.87,
          "en": "And this is how we can get started",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 130,
          "start": 342.87,
          "end": 344.89,
          "en": "with this file based routing.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 131,
          "start": 344.89,
          "end": 348.27,
          "en": "And as you see, by looking at the page source,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 132,
          "start": 348.27,
          "end": 350.72,
          "en": "in addition to that file based routing,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 133,
          "start": 350.72,
          "end": 352.90999999999997,
          "en": "we also already use that",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 134,
          "start": 352.90999999999997,
          "end": 355.15,
          "en": "built-in server-side rendering feature",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 135,
          "start": 355.15,
          "end": 356.81,
          "en": "without any extra setup",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 136,
